2" decimals="-6" name="pep:ImpairmentAndOtherCharges" scale="6" id="f-708">83</ix:nonFraction> million recorded in impairment of intangible assets and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-123" decimals="-6" name="pep:ImpairmentAndOtherCharges" scale="6" id="f-709">17</ix:nonFraction> million recorded in selling, general and administrative expenses. In the 36 weeks ended September&#160;6, 2025, we recorded pre-tax charges of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-22" decimals="-6" name="pep:ImpairmentAndOtherCharges" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-710">1,960</ix:nonFraction> million ($<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-22" decimals="-6" name="pep:ImpairmentAndOtherChargesAfterTax" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-711">1,539</ix:nonFraction> million after-tax or $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="c-22" decimals="2" name="pep:ImpairmentAndOtherChargesPerShare" scale="0" id="f-712">1.12</ix:nonFraction> per share), primarily related to the impairment of the Rockstar brand in our PBNA, EMEA and IB Franchise segments and the Be &amp; Cheery brand in our Asia Pacific Foods segment, with $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-124" decimals="-6" name="pep:ImpairmentAndOtherCharges" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="f-713">1,943</ix:nonFraction> million recorded in impairment of intangible assets and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-123" decimals="-6" name="pep:ImpairmentAndOtherCharges" scale="6" id="f-714">17</ix:nonFraction> million recorded in selling, general and administrative expenses. See Note 4 for further information.</span></div><div style="padding-left:18pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(e)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.03pt">In the 12 and 36 weeks ended Sep